{"id":"n41393-1-8","stage":2,"title":"늦잠 · 懒觉","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41393-1-8-1","ko":"주말에 뭐 하세요?","zh":"周末有什么安排吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말에","audio":"/audio/ff068f34f21f5a2dea38.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}},{"text":"하세요?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하세요","audio":"/audio/20c70a963b62c0806108.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/980c7f9aabd7fdf1eecb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41393-1-8-2","ko":"다른 계획은 없고 느긋하게 늦잠이나 즐기려고요.","zh":"没有别的计划，打算悠闲地多睡会儿觉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"계획은","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계획은","audio":"/audio/2cc0a71c35e5788ef857.mp3"}},{"text":"없고","meaning":"没有（其他计划）","explanation":"없다：没有（其他计划）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"2","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없고","audio":"/audio/4efd3b8cd0ddc58fed1a.mp3"}},{"text":"느긋하게","meaning":"轻松，悠闲","explanation":"느긋하다：轻松，悠闲；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"느긋하다","audio":"/audio/b8a37bf7c2eab961e9ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40387","senseId":"1","lemma":"느긋하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느긋하게","audio":"/audio/fc5d0edb73d99dfbd10b.mp3"}},{"text":"늦잠이나","meaning":"懒觉","explanation":"늦잠：懒觉；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"늦잠","audio":"/audio/4dc69297f0f60b6cd02e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41393","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦잠이나","audio":"/audio/e7207a567c7a64cb6544.mp3"}},{"text":"즐기려고요.","meaning":"享受","explanation":"즐기다：享受；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"즐기다","audio":"/audio/52a5578b574f2755fc41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91878","senseId":"1","lemma":"즐기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"즐기려고요","audio":"/audio/fc4a66f9006cfe723eef.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"b0fe4ea3ac5ac402","term":"계획","zh":"计划，筹划","